   "size": "LARGE"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-munich/lh_app_munich_isar_getty638561876_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "View along the Isar in Munich"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "A Perfect Day in Munich",
   "size": "EXTRA_LARGE",
   "variant": "HEADLINE"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>22. June 2025 | 3 min read | Manfred Samhuber</b>",
   "size": "SMALL",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>A visit to the Deutsches Museum, a leisurely walk along the Isar and plenty of culinary delights: Manfred Samhuber describes the ideal way to experience Munich in one day.</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Morning</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-munich/lh_blog_munich_botanical-garden_unsplash-VIBex97kgi0_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Interior view of the Botanical Garden in Munich"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Enjoy the Botanical Garden</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>With over 16,240 species and subspecies, the Botanical Garden in Munich is one of the most important in the world</li><li>I feel like I'm in a jungle in Southeast Asia inside the greenhouses – and the photo opportunities are truly amazing</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Menzinger Str. 65",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Visit the Deutsches Museum</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>This is one of the largest science and technology museums in the world</li><li>There are 20 exhibitions to explore, covering everything from aviation and chemistry to robotics and health</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Museumsinsel 1",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Midday</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-munich/lh_app_munich_cafe_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Interior view of the Daddy Longlegs"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Lunch at Daddy Longlegs</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>I grab a midday snack here: they not only have the friendliest staff, but also offer delicious Bali-style treats</li><li>Tip: be sure to try the Banana Bread!</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Barer Str. 42",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Pinakothek der Moderne</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>Feeling well-fueled, I head to another of my favorite museums, the Pinakothek der Moderne</li><li>Tip: visit the museum on a Sunday – entry is just 1 euro</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Barer Str. 40",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "spacer",
   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
  {
