  {
   "type": "spacer",
   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Afternoon</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-munich/lh_app_munich_market_getty1412491952_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Fruit and vegetable stalls at Viktualenmarkt"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Walk Along the Isar River</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>I love strolling along the Isar during the day – or meeting up with friends there in the evening</li><li>Tip: grab a drink from the kiosk at Wittelsbacher Bridge or Cornelius Bridge and sit down by the water</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Fresh Goodies at Viktualienmarkt</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>A quick stop at this market, whose stalls never fail to impress with fresh produce and specialties</li><li>It's especially cozy in the beer garden right in the middle of the space</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Evening</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/europe/a-perfect-day-in-munich/lh_app_munich_bahnwaerter-thiel_c_fabian-christ_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Sunset at Bahnwärther Thiel with railway tracks and containers"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Dinner at Donisl</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>A traditional roast pork with dumplings is a must</li><li>This classic venue on Marienplatz serves it just like my grandma used to</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Weinstraße 1",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Cocktails at Yum Thai</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>For a cocktail, I head to Yum Thai – an Asian bar and restaurant with fantastic lighting</li><li>By the way: try the Pad Thai, it’s the best this side of Bangkok</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Utzschneiderstraße 6",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Dancing at Bahnwärter Thiel</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>This cultural venue is a quirky mix of Munich tram and subway cars, colorfully painted shipping containers, and a crane outfitted with floating gondolas and vintage carriages</li><li>It’s my favorite place to dance to electronic music</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Tumblingerstraße 45",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Copyrights: Alexander Goettert | Deutsches Museum, Getty Images, PR, Selina Bubendorfer/Unsplash",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>About</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Manfred Samhuber comes from Munich and is a flight attendant for Lufthansa. He loves to explore the world with his camera. For him, his hometown of Munich is the perfect mix of nature, shopping, and cuisine. And of course, only here in Bavaria you'll get to eat the perfect roast pork.",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
